    ],
    "related": [
      "attention-feature-integration",
      "attention-selective-attention",
      "attention-distractor-interference"
    ],
    "engineering_link": "搜索斜率对应计算复杂度，是界面信息密度与视觉显著性设计的量化参照。",
    "references": [
      {
        "type": "textbook",
        "title": "Cognitive Neuroscience: The Biology of the Mind (Gazzaniga et al., 5th ed., 2018)",
